CORE libcxx
main.cpp
--cpp14 --stdlib libc++
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ own pack: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ full range: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ empty range: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
Runtime-verified with clang++ (g++ rejects the alias-template pack
deduction shape).  Assertion 3 (the empty range) additionally guards
against silent swallowing: pre-fix the enclosing instantiation failed
and main was truncated after assertion 2.
